# Betűvető environment variables.
# Copy to `.env` (or set in your deployment) and adjust as needed.

# --- Backend (FastAPI) ---
# Comma-separated list of allowed browser origins. Credentials are sent, so a
# wildcard is NOT valid here.
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173

# Absolute path to the Hungarian word list. Defaults to the repo-root
# `data/magyar-szavak.txt`; the Docker/HF deployment sets this explicitly.
# WORDLIST_PATH=/app/data/magyar-szavak.txt

# --- Frontend (Vite) ---
# Base URL the frontend uses to reach the API. Defaults to `/api` (same-origin,
# proxied in dev). Override only for split deployments.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# --- Database / Supabase (Batch 1) ---
# Connection string for the Supabase Postgres, used by `npm run db:import` (the wordlist
# importer), `npm run db:verify`, and the API functions. Point this at the CLOUD project
# and use the *transaction pooler* string (Supabase dashboard → Project Settings →
# Database → Connection string → Transaction pooler). The direct host
# (db.<ref>.supabase.co) is IPv6-only and will simply time out on an IPv4-only network.
# Do NOT run a local Supabase stack — apply and validate against the hosted project.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.<ref>:...@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres

# On Vercel these are injected by the Supabase connector — you should not set them by
# hand. The API reads POSTGRES_URL, falling back to DATABASE_URL when run locally.
# POSTGRES_URL=...

# Server-only Supabase keys. The service-role key bypasses Row Level Security and must
# NEVER be exposed to the browser (no VITE_ prefix).
# SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=...

# --- Testing the deployed API (Batch 1.2) ---
# The HTTP contract suite runs against a deployment rather than a local server:
#   BASE_URL=https://<preview>.vercel.app npm test
# If Vercel deployment protection is enabled, also pass the automation bypass secret
# (Vercel → Settings → Deployment Protection → Protection Bypass for Automation).
# BASE_URL=https://<preview>.vercel.app
# VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET=...
